                        },
                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "The low poly aesthetic design of this game is beautiful and the soundtrack slaps (immerses you in the wartime period). But the real beauty is how fast your bomber mission can go from low to OFF THE SCALE cortisol when you get jumped by german fighter planes. Really teaches you to prepare for rather than react to chaos by doing small stuff like healing up your aircrew, managing fuel status, setting navigational waypoints in advance, and calling recon and fighter support as necessary etc etc. The one frustrating thing is that getting your landing wheels shot off could be a death sentence because doing an emergency belly landing doesn't guarantee the safety of the crew, but then again, it wasn't safe in ww2 either. \n\nSo get out there and make bomber harris proud :)",
